## Two honest notes about what this data is

1. **The numbers are read automatically** from public pricing pages and can be
   misread. Records later proven wrong are never deleted; they are annotated in
   `data/changes/corrections.jsonl`, and the counters exclude them. If you
   build on this data, read that file too.

2. **Raw HTML snapshots** under `data/raw/` are archived copies of vendor
   pages, kept so every recorded number can be checked against its source.
   Those pages remain the property of their respective owners and are **not**
   covered by this licence. Product names and trademarks belong to their
   respective owners; this project is not affiliated with any vendor.
